{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poltergeist Prodigy is a single-player, story-focused, puzzle action-adventure game, a first person haunter where you delight in being a mischievous ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.poster.avif?t=1743584612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.webm?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.mp4?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new ghost, and to continue existing and uncover how you died you must haunt the living. With guidance from a comedic, more experienced ghost, you will learn to haunt people and animals with a variety of techniques in a range of places. By throwing objects around, conjuring scary aspects, possessing people, and ultilising many more haunting abilities, you will scare your way to becoming a more powerful spirit and trigger memories of how you died and the mysterious circumstances behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a short and compelling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with everything. As a ghost you can move or otherwise manipulate everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, summon \u2018scary\u2019 aspects, manipulate appliances, possess the living.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced, comedic guiding mentor teaches you how to haunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasingly 